     <item row="1" column="3" colspan="3">
      <widget class="QLabel" name="label_6">
       <property name="text">
        <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;The characteristics folder includes two files:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Events file:&lt;/span&gt; Contains all events in Snooz annotation format.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Summary file:&lt;/span&gt; Contains per-event details, including start time, peak time, end time, duration,&lt;br/&gt;LOC/ROC absolute amplitude at REM peak (μV), and LOC/ROC absolute rise and fall slopes (μV/s).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
       </property>
      </widget>
     </item>
     <item row="3" column="3" colspan="2">
      <widget class="QLabel" name="label_2">
       <property name="text">
        <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Included parameters:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- REMs count&lt;br/&gt;- Duration of the REMs in second&lt;br/&gt;- Amplitude of the REMs (Difference between the peak and trough of the [LOC - ROC])&lt;br/&gt;- Density of the REMs in cycles and hours&lt;br/&gt;- Variablity of the densities&lt;br/&gt;- Phasic/Tonic REM percentage&lt;br/&gt;- Peak-to-Peak energy in uv squared&lt;br/&gt;- Peak-to-Peak activity index&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The report consists of the average of the mentioned characteristics in:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- total (all night)&lt;br/&gt;- per sleep cycle&lt;br/&gt;- per clock hour&lt;br/&gt;- per hour spent in each stage&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
       </property>
      </widget>
     </item>
